meta {
  name: loginOrganizerCsrf
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/auth/organizer/login
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Organizer Login (CSRF)
  
  This route gives you the CSRF token required to fill the form for logging in as an organizer through the mobile application. Without this, your request will be rejected.
  
  ## 200 OK
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Organizer login action initiated successfully",
    "key": "csrf-token-string"
  }
  ```
  The CSRF token must be sent in the subsequent request under the `X-Csrf-Token` header.
  
  ## 500 Internal Server Error
  If you see this, report to the backend team immediately.
  ```json
  {
    "message": "Oops! Something happened. Please try again later."
  }
  ```
}
